{"version": 1, "slug": "tistory-23", "visibility": "public", "title": "[DreamHack] - study_checker", "content": "<div class=\"tistory-content\">\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/58cc3bce01036365f95e7bfd26b45c08b8886ba8fe3d0fb79f557041404543c8.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>드림핵 study_checker 문제</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/276bdbbb2cd65aab2afc45650d101783d2ebc574d6c33fd40d9c6a1252395dca.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>문제자체의 파일</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/64e7d4d4b781b61fedc08f1d47d6ea7b2906ee8a2c2486d21f4a5df12feb5122.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>포렌식 강의 자료 내려받기의 파일</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>파일을 모두 다운받은 후 FTK Imager에서 이미지 마운팅</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/9c9f9bbf60ba1925dc2b4b926f3b5a5082b87bb3dfcbf8f302c88c54f0a47fc8.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/33791454d133545f5f027e0e690199e3cc0de6269f70ebf982d54328c097a760.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>파일 선택</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/9bf7c6f7f83d2b5b1552e9c9c382ba68928d7a75938c307241486d11872191ae.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>로컬 디스크 D, E, F, G 가 만들어짐</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/25cdeaa6641c7f1eab84c209e40afa39eb92897b30ed9f5dc2cbe8efc9fb7ac9.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>로컬 디스크 F 안에 웬만한 파일들이 있는 것을 확인, 이를 FTK Imager로 열어봄</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/070515dc8d46ca804c0ec4138939642116b69072e9e0179bd5fdc570f44ddccb.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/e5b07a11bacbad35fcf8182bc26e33117176ec2fb422241e1f6738fd0ceea3fb.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>여기서 Windows/Prefetch 파일을 선택 후 Export Files</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/4b94dc8f7838079d63b557e57f72369f7a7a865e9e9507a80ec865ec343f140b.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/b6c07d0e7127889cb480ee72fb29546eae324a041c2e0668e4ee446b51f55390.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>PECmd 설치 후 exe 파일을 Prefetch 파일이 있는 곳에 붙여넣기</p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/216a98bace71d08bac60e991e9f292d177a7f16f3e3839ae755917a6bc86d30b.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Poweshell에 명령어 입력</p>\n<p> </p>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>.\\PECmd.exe -d \"C:\\경로\\Prefetch\" --csv \"C:\\원하는 경로\" --csvf result.csv</code></pre>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/a741d8a984c229240588b818bcbccddcb80eeeb98fdea9e1d2aebf169ff876cf.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>많은 파일이 있는것이 확인, result.csv 파일 생성</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/27a8b6928eb892eedcc8236eb684e06af14cc587579c42f3b64562b7453a04e9.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>csv 파일을 연 후 게임과 관련된 파일 찾음</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/e7d70d003e38fb3e8bd154a5b130bfbe84548ea7bd8884abdedccc467e9fcdfe.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>지뢰찾기</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/bb08e2ff716e4d04f3fd42bd31cf17d2f175ca41fe6771b4956f65a029de9652.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>핀볼</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>FTK Imager로 다시 간 후 이 파일들의 최초 실행 시각, 마지막 실행 시각을 확인 후 flag로 작성</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/730c04f31e2140ec13a5d942799da31126d63866f3b79f8b2bb4edb4be6da3b0.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>", "assets": ["070515dc8d46ca804c0ec4138939642116b69072e9e0179bd5fdc570f44ddccb.png", "216a98bace71d08bac60e991e9f292d177a7f16f3e3839ae755917a6bc86d30b.png", "25cdeaa6641c7f1eab84c209e40afa39eb92897b30ed9f5dc2cbe8efc9fb7ac9.png", "276bdbbb2cd65aab2afc45650d101783d2ebc574d6c33fd40d9c6a1252395dca.png", "27a8b6928eb892eedcc8236eb684e06af14cc587579c42f3b64562b7453a04e9.png", "33791454d133545f5f027e0e690199e3cc0de6269f70ebf982d54328c097a760.png", "4b94dc8f7838079d63b557e57f72369f7a7a865e9e9507a80ec865ec343f140b.png", "58cc3bce01036365f95e7bfd26b45c08b8886ba8fe3d0fb79f557041404543c8.png", "64e7d4d4b781b61fedc08f1d47d6ea7b2906ee8a2c2486d21f4a5df12feb5122.png", "730c04f31e2140ec13a5d942799da31126d63866f3b79f8b2bb4edb4be6da3b0.png", "9bf7c6f7f83d2b5b1552e9c9c382ba68928d7a75938c307241486d11872191ae.png", "9c9f9bbf60ba1925dc2b4b926f3b5a5082b87bb3dfcbf8f302c88c54f0a47fc8.png", "a741d8a984c229240588b818bcbccddcb80eeeb98fdea9e1d2aebf169ff876cf.png", "b6c07d0e7127889cb480ee72fb29546eae324a041c2e0668e4ee446b51f55390.png", "bb08e2ff716e4d04f3fd42bd31cf17d2f175ca41fe6771b4956f65a029de9652.png", "e5b07a11bacbad35fcf8182bc26e33117176ec2fb422241e1f6738fd0ceea3fb.png", "e7d70d003e38fb3e8bd154a5b130bfbe84548ea7bd8884abdedccc467e9fcdfe.png"]}